{"n":27,"title":"A word of advice","blurb":"Asking for and giving advice, and a model covering letter","steps":[{"stage":"Vocabulary","type":"cards","title":"Слова урока","sub":"Нажми на карточку, чтобы увидеть перевод","words":[{"en":"advice","pos":"n","ru":"совет, советы","kk":"кеңес","def":"an opinion you give someone about what they should do","img":"/course/a2/img/l27-advice.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/8015f1d1fd4a.mp3"},{"en":"argument","pos":"n","ru":"спор, ссора","kk":"дау, талас","def":"an angry conversation between people who disagree","img":"/course/a2/img/l27-argument.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/0f3802314d74.mp3"},{"en":"assignment","pos":"n","ru":"задание, работа","kk":"тапсырма","def":"a piece of work that a student or an employee is given to do","img":"/course/a2/img/l27-assignment.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/f26b63d628c9.mp3"},{"en":"ceremony","pos":"n","ru":"церемония","kk":"салтанат","def":"a formal public event held to mark an important occasion","img":"/course/a2/img/l27-ceremony.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/92efd0d199f5.mp3"},{"en":"experiment","pos":"n","ru":"эксперимент","kk":"тәжірибе","def":"a scientific test done to find out what happens","img":"/course/a2/img/l27-experiment.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/f45f2bc801bb.mp3"},{"en":"graduation","pos":"n","ru":"выпуск, вручение дипломов","kk":"бітіру салтанаты","def":"the ceremony at which students receive their degree","img":"/course/a2/img/l27-graduation.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/a56160931185.mp3"},{"en":"philosophy","pos":"n","ru":"философия, подход","kk":"философия, ұстаным","def":"the study of the nature of knowledge, existence and how we should live","img":"/course/a2/img/l27-philosophy.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/00b32f658d1b.mp3"},{"en":"press","pos":"v","ru":"нажимать","kk":"басу","def":"newspapers, magazines and the journalists who work for them","img":"/course/a2/img/l27-press.webp","audio":"/learning/audio/a2/cd09e18a9bd7.mp3"},{"en":"stick t